Hi Rahul,

It seems your program is parsing "testConfig1" as something else. The message "Unknown parameter" comes from your C++ program, not from irace.
If you are using some library to parse command-line parameters, you need to tell the library that there are 3 extra non-option positional arguments.

Cheers,

Manuel.

